\item[S2] Ryan Alweiss, Shachar Lovett, Kewen Wu and Jiapeng Zhang, \emph{Improved bounds for the sunflower lemma}, arXiv:1908.08483v3 (2021), Definition 1.1 and Conjecture 1.3. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1908.08483}.
